# 两个服务统一使用仓库根目录作为构建上下文。
# 首先忽略所有文件
**

# Codex 仅包含应用源码、共享配置和构建输入。
!fersk_codex/
fersk_codex/**
!fersk_codex/Dockerfile
!fersk_codex/pyproject.toml
!fersk_codex/uv.lock
!fersk_codex/README.md
!fersk_codex/__init__.py
!fersk_codex/main.py
!fersk_codex/configs/
fersk_codex/configs/**
!fersk_codex/configs/*.json
!fersk_codex/configs/*.py
!fersk_codex/codex/
fersk_codex/codex/**
!fersk_codex/codex/*.py
!fersk_codex/middleware/
fersk_codex/middleware/**
!fersk_codex/middleware/*.py
!fersk_codex/session/
fersk_codex/session/**
!fersk_codex/session/*.py
!fersk_codex/services/
fersk_codex/services/**
!fersk_codex/services/*.py
!fersk_codex/services/lark/
fersk_codex/services/lark/**
!fersk_codex/services/lark/*.py
!fersk_codex/utils/
fersk_codex/utils/**
!fersk_codex/utils/*.py
!fersk_codex/docker/
fersk_codex/docker/**
!fersk_codex/docker/entrypoint.sh

# MCP 保留整个目录内容
!fersk_mcp/
!fersk_mcp/**

# 公共排除规则必须放在白名单之后，避免被重新包含。
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist
**/.env
**/.git
**/tests
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/skills-office
**/skills